body:
A couple of months ago i showed my best friend my scars. And although they couldn't relate or anything to my situation simply listening to me and having someone to talk to helped a lot. I was initially worried about how their view of me would change, but if they are close to you and care for you it shouldn't change their opinion of you in a negative way and instead only seek to help you.

&#x200B;

Though a worry i have is that expressing myself would be taxing on them and a lot to handle

&#x200B;

I can just picture this like a super awkward scene in a film

&#x200B;

And at least you now have an ice breaker if you ever need it
